+  recorded in the process fallback counters, warns once per reason, and
+  recomputes the exact reference with ``F.linear``.  The only exception is an
+  opaque packed-weight handle (1-D uint8): there is no meaningful torch
+  fallback for it, so it fails closed with ``packed_handle_invalid``.
